==='''Eternity Challenges Milestones'''===
{{Keyword|eternity|Eternity Challenges}} have their own milestones based on the number of EC completed.
#3 EC completions: Keep your [[Infinity#Infinity_Challenges|{{Keyword|inf|Infinity Challenges}}]] on {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} ''(including fastest completion times)''
#5 EC completions: [[Revolution#Prestige|Prestiging]] now resets nothing
#8 EC completions: Unlocks [[Eternity#Supernova|Supernova]]
#10 EC completions: Keep fastest [[Infinity|{{Keyword|inf|Infinity}}]] time on {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} ''(needed for [[Eternity#Animals_Milestones|Animals Milestone]] 5 to work correctly)''
#30 EC completions: Every 4 Supernovae gives 1 free level to all [[Eternity#Laboratory|{{Keyword|rp|RP}}]] upgrades
#32 EC completions: Every 4 Supernovae gives another free level to all [[Eternity#Laboratory|{{Keyword|rp|RP}}]] upgrades
#35 EC completions: Every 2 Supernovae gives another free level on all [[Eternity#Laboratory|{{Keyword|rp|RP}}]] upgrades
#50 EC completions: Unlocks [[Eternity#Dilation_&_Dilation_Tree|{{Keyword|dtp|Dilation Tree}}]]
#60 EC completions: 2x more Magnet Chance
=='''Supernova'''==
Supernova is the fifth {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} tab, unlocked by reaching [[Eternity#Eternity_Challenges_Milestones|Eternity Challenges Milestone]] 3 (8 {{Keyword|eternity|EC}} completions).

Supernovae are obtained by reaching a certain [[Revolution#Score|Score]] and using the "Go Supernova" button within the tab. Going Supernova will start a new {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} and provide Supernova bonuses to the player, as follows:

* [[Eternity#Eternity_Bonuses|Eternity reward]] Mult
* [[Infinity#Stars|Star Base]] Mult
* [[Eternity#Laboratory|Lab Base]] Mult
* {{Keyword|ep|EP}} gain Mult
* + [[Eternity#Animals|{{Keyword|ap|AP}}]]

In general, Supernovae should be performed as soon as possible, for the bonuses they reward. However, in some cases the player may want to delay going Supernova (for example, in the later part of [[Eternity#Dilation_&_Dilation_Tree|{{Keyword|dilation|Dilation Tree}}]], in order to first gain more [[Eternity#Animals|{{Keyword|ap|AP}}]]).

=='''Dilation'''==
{{Keyword|dilation|Dilation}} is the sixth {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} tab, unlocked by reaching [[Eternity#Animals_Milestones|Animals Milestone]] 7 (own all 81 [[Eternity#Animals|Animals]]).

Now the player can enter and exit {{Keyword|dilation|Dilation}}, by using the Go/Exit Dilation button within the tab. Upon entering, a new {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} will begin, but with {{Keyword|dilation|Dilation}} penalties applied.

The base {{Keyword|dilation|Dilation}} penalties are as follows:

* Common Exponent / 25
* [[Infinity#Generators|Gen Exp]] / 1,000
* [[Infinity#Stars|Star Exp]] / 100
* [[Revolution#Ascension|Ascension Power]] ^0.10
* ([[Revolution|Laps Speed]] ^0.10) / 10
* [[Infinity|{{Keyword|ip|IP}}]] gain ^0.01
Exiting {{Keyword|dilation|Dilation}} will start a new {{Keyword|eternity|Eternity}} and the player's Max Score will be set to the maximum [[Revolution#Score|Score]] reached in {{Keyword|dilation|Dilation}}.

The purpose of increasing Max Score is to generate more {{Keyword|dp|Dilation Points}} ({{Keyword|dp|DP}}), as the player's {{Keyword|dp|DP}} Income ({{Keyword|dp|DP}} per second) is based on this.

